  "label": "Misogynous Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on a misogynistic stereotype that portrays women as incompetent or morally inferior in crisis situations, reducing their potential actions to transactional or sexualized behavior. This stereotype devalues women's competence and reinforces harmful gender norms by implying that women will resort to prostitution or flirtation when faced with economic hardship, rather than demonstrating self-reliance or preparedness.",
